  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to analyse and map the FinTech landscape in Egypt in relation to private sector development. This sound context analysis is crucial as it provides a comprehensive understanding of the specific conditions, factors, and dynamics influencing FinTech/digitalisation in Egypt. The analysis serves as a foundation for informed decision-making, strategic planning, and effective resource allocation, ensuring that digitalisation efforts align with the local context.</narrative>
